@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title UC03 — Activate a relationship profile
actor Administrator
participant "Native profile form" as UI
participant profiles as Profiles
participant profile_config as Rules
database "Profile / revision" as DB
Administrator -> UI : Submit JSON
UI -> Profiles : save(json, profileid)
Profiles -> Rules : Validate constructor
alt supported document
  Profiles -> DB : Store / activate revision under lock
  DB --> Profiles : Active revision
  Profiles --> UI : Confirmation
else invalid document
  Profiles --> UI : Configuration error
end
@enduml
